WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:03.210
AI you can defend.

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:08.319
Because the work moves fast, and someone still has to answer for it.

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:15.404
AI and law is the axis of the firm:

00:00:15.404 --> 00:00:19.036
advisory, ongoing accompaniment, and training

00:00:19.036 --> 00:00:23.151
for organizations adopting artificial intelligence.

00:00:23.751 --> 00:00:27.538
From usage policy, to audit, to documentation.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.969
The engine runs inside your practice.

00:00:33.569 --> 00:00:36.460
It audits exposure as the work happens,

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:38.090
automates the routine,

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:41.574
and keeps a documented trail on every decision.

00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:46.345
And it puts the sharp calls back where they belong: with the lawyer.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:54.402
That is the Clinic: advisory, ongoing accompaniment, and training.

00:00:55.002 --> 00:00:58.055
Real questions, answered by a person.

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:04.397
Eight questions. Two minutes. Then we talk.

00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:07.292
Start at lalumapp.com.
